        },
        "schema": "pneuma.source.meeting/v1",
        "provider": "mock",
        "meeting_id": "g21m-meet01",
        "title": "状态词回看：一句纠正到底改了什么",
        "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:30:00+08:00",
        "ended_at": "2026-05-02T16:07:00+08:00",
        "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
        "owner_participant_ids": ["linzhou"],
        "participants": [
          {
            "participant_id": "linzhou",
            "display_name": "林舟",
            "role": "product",
            "synthetic_address": "lin.zhou@seamlog.test"
          },
          {
            "participant_id": "chenfang",
            "display_name": "陈放",
            "role": "customer",
            "synthetic_address": "fang.chen@northfield.test"
          }
        ],
        "agenda": [
          {
            "agenda_id": "g21m-ag01",
            "text": "回看“不是这个意思”纠正的是原话、系统解释还是后续动作",
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-ag-auth01",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:28:00+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agenda_id": "g21m-ag02",
            "text": "检验待确认、已确认、已撤回三种候选说法会造成的误读",
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-ag-auth02",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:29:00+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "utterances": [
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u01",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:30:04+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:31:12+08:00",
            "text": "我把上次那句单独拿出来了。你先说“可以照这个改”，后来又说“不是这个意思”。我当时把后一句标成撤回前一句，今天重看觉得可能擅自加了一个动作。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth01",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:30:04+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u02",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:31:18+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:32:31+08:00",
            "text": "对，问题就在这儿。我说“不是这个意思”，是你把“先换样板”讲成了“整套都换”。我在纠正范围，不是把同意过的那一步取消。你一写已撤回，别人会以为什么都没说过。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth02",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:31:18+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u03",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:32:38+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:33:52+08:00",
            "text": "那原句保留，后一句指向我写的范围解释。可如果只看一个状态词，读者还是不知道被纠正的是哪一层。我是不是该把状态和它指向的对象一起显示？",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth03",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:32:38+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u04",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:34:00+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:35:22+08:00",
            "text": "先别急着变成界面答案。你得先分清对象：原话、你概括出来的范围、还是后续要做的动作。三样东西都可能被人说“不对”，但不该因此一起变成撤回。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth04",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:34:00+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u05",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:35:31+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:36:30+08:00",
            "text": "等我关一下窗。楼下小孩在拍球，正好每三下撞一次铁门，我刚才把你最后几个字听成了“都撤回”。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth05",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:35:31+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "noise",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": [],
                "continuity_ids": []
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u06",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:36:37+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:37:34+08:00",
            "text": "我这边也在楼道里，信号会断。先记一句：我没有说三种状态一定够，也没同意它们现在就叫这三个名字。只是你拿来的三个卡片里，至少有两张被你混用了。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth06",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:36:37+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "ambiguous",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u07",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:37:40+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:39:02+08:00",
            "text": "我把待确认理解成没人表态，已确认理解成有人同意，已撤回理解成后来取消。照你刚才的例子，先同意一个小范围、但范围还没被双方说清，放哪张卡都像在撒谎。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth07",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:37:40+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u08",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:38:51+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:40:20+08:00",
            "text": "不是这个意思——我打断一下。不是“双方没说清”，是我说清了小范围，你的摘要扩大了。原话本身可以被确认，摘要仍然待你修；一个记录里可能同时有两个不同状态。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": "g21m-u07",
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth08",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:38:51+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u09",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:40:28+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:41:59+08:00",
            "text": "明白了，刚才又是我把纠正当成没有答案。那状态短句至少得带对象和变化：哪句话被确认、哪段概括等修改、哪个动作真的被取消。只亮一个“已”字，听起来像结果，实际没有上下文。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth09",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:40:28+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u10",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:42:05+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:43:26+08:00",
            "text": "还有“确认”也危险。确认收到、确认原话、同意执行，不是一回事。我平时说“收到了”，你不能因为里面有个确认动作，就把方案标成已经通过。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth10",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:42:05+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u11",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:43:34+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:45:12+08:00",
            "text": "我先按信息用途拆，不先定词：一类告诉人还在等哪种判断，一类告诉人哪个对象已有明确答复，一类说明某个先前动作被本人取消。进度、结果和错误也不能借同一张卡互相顶替。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth11",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:43:34+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u12",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:45:19+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:46:33+08:00",
            "text": "这个拆法可以继续试，但“被本人取消”也别先写死。有时候是时限过了，有时候是提出的人收回，有时候只是另一个版本替代。它们是否共用一类，我今天答不了。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth12",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:45:19+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "ambiguous",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u13",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:46:41+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:47:54+08:00",
            "text": "那我今天只留下三种语义问题，不把待确认、已确认、已撤回写成定稿名称。下一版每个样例都要同时显示对象、说话人和时间，看看还有没有第四种情况。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth13",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:46:41+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u14",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:48:02+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:49:20+08:00",
            "text": "还要留一句人的解释。别让我点了一个词之后，原来那句“只换样板”反而看不见。状态是后来加的判断，不该覆盖当时说了什么。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth14",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:48:02+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "signal",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": ["F04"],
                "continuity_ids": ["C01"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u15",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:49:29+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:50:31+08:00",
            "text": "门外送餐到了，我下楼前再确认一个小问题。晚点我和赵楠约了吃面，不会把今天这些带过去。你下午还方便看我改后的样例吗？不方便就别勉强，今天本来就是假期。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth15",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:49:29+08:00",
              "author_role": "product",
              "content_class": "noise",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": [],
                "continuity_ids": []
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u16",
            "speaker_id": "chenfang",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:50:38+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:51:43+08:00",
            "text": "今天别发，我一会儿去接家里人，手机也快没电。下次只给我两三个会冲突的例子，别拿一整页让我替你挑名称。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {
              "authored_id": "g21m-auth16",
              "occurred_at": "2026-05-02T15:50:38+08:00",
              "author_role": "customer",
              "content_class": "noise",
              "links": {
                "story_beat_ids": ["D62"],
                "fact_ids": [],
                "continuity_ids": []
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g21m-u17",
            "speaker_id": "linzhou",
            "started_at": "2026-05-02T15:51:50+08:00",
            "ended_at": "2026-05-02T15:53:08+08:00",
